    "description": "The Telecom SIM Verification API enables businesses to verify the validity of telecom SIM cards in batch processes. By providing a streamlined approach to request the verification of multiple SIM cards, this API enhances operational efficiency and accuracy for telecommunications providers. Typical consumers include telecom companies and service providers looking to automate the verification process, ensuring compliance and reducing fraud. The service allows seamless integration into existing workflows, allowing users to manage and confirm SIM card authenticity effectively.",
